<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>RAZR SLIDE R18 · 跨舱FPC联合运动</title><style>
:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0b1624;--panel:#172638;--card:#1e3046;--ink:#e8f1f9;--muted:#aabacd;--hot:#ff9956;--screen:#26ced2;--blue:#4e9ae0;--red:#ff7581;--ok:#66d1a1}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.65 system-ui,-apple-system,"Noto Sans CJK JP","Microsoft Yahei",sans-serif}
header{padding:26px 32px;border-bottom:1px solid #314056;background:linear-gradient(105deg,#0c2238,#11192c)}h1{font-size:24px;margin:0;color:white}h2{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 10px}p{margin:7px 0;color:var(--muted)}small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.shell{max-width:1400px;margin:auto}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:360px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:18px 20px}.pane{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid #2c4055;border-radius:15px;padding:18px}.control{margin:18px 0}.control label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px}.control input{width:100%;accent-color:#e9934d}.presets{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}button{color:white;background:#254767;border:1px solid #3c5b78;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#37678b}.views{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.plot{min-height:660px;background:#0e1e30;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #34495f;padding:12px}.plot svg{width:100%;height:625px}.badge{border:1px solid #a63e48;color:#ff909a;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;display:inline-block}.metric{margin:15px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}.metric>div{background:#1d3649;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px}.metric b{display:block;font-size:19px;color:#fff}.legend{color:#a8c8da;font-size:12px}.legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:4px}.notes{padding:6px 22px 28px;color:#aabbcc}.notes strong{color:#f4c7a0}.foot{font-size:12px;color:#9fb1c2;padding:4px 0}
@media(max-width:1000px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.views{grid-template-columns:1fr}.plot{min-height:500px}.plot svg{height:500px}header{padding:18px}}
</style></head><body><div class="shell"><header><h1>RAZR SLIDE · R18 跨舱FPC运动学查看器</h1><p>真实功能：单块柔性主屏、等尺寸双舱、B舱从后方向上滑，之后再前后齐平。新橙色曲线是连接A与B的独立动态FPC，而不是B舱内部显示FPC。</p><span class="badge">几何与真实CAD检查发现冲突 · 不可制造</span></header>
<div class="row"><section class="pane"><h2>机构状态</h2><div class="presets"><button onclick="pose(0,0)">收纳</button><button onclick="pose(39.875,0)">Y 50%</button><button onclick="pose(79.75,0)">Y到位</button><button onclick="pose(79.75,4.1)">Z 50%</button><button onclick="pose(79.75,8.2)">完全齐平</button></div>
<div class="control"><label>纵向上滑 <output id="yv">0.00 mm</output></label><input type="range" id="ys" min="0" max="79.75" step="0.25" value="0"></div>
<div class="control"><label>前后就位 <output id="zv">0.00 mm</output></label><input type="range" id="zs" min="0" max="8.2" step="0.1" value="0"></div>
<p class="foot">仅当Y完全到位时允许Z运动；这个输入联锁仅用于查看器，不是物理安全机构。</p>
<div class="metric"><div><small>跨舱FPC假设中性长度</small><b id="len">136.375</b><small>mm</small></div><div><small>回环Y顶点</small><b id="fold">70.00</b><small>mm</small></div><div><small>FPC最小名义半径</small><b>5.00</b><small>mm（未认证）</small></div><div><small>原6mm槽宽缺口</small><b style="color:var(--red)">4.82</b><small>mm</small></div></div>
<h2>必须同时解决的物理失败</h2><p>① 原机架穿模；② 横向10.82mm通道占电池空间；③ 直接切槽使机架分裂；④ 某些姿态与OLED或本舱FPC相交；⑤ OLED R3.4与假设制造公差的余量不足。</p><p>图形为路径中心线与简化机身投影。只有5个关键姿态完成STEP实体碰撞核验；中间滑块状态的实时绘制<strong>不是</strong>连续三维干涉验收。</p></section>
<section class="views"><div class="plot"><h2>X–Y 平面：跨舱回环</h2><svg id="plan" viewBox="0 0 420 660" aria-label="plan view"></svg><div class="legend"><i style="background:var(--hot)"></i>跨舱动态FPC　<i style="background:var(--blue)"></i>移动B舱　<i style="background:#778798"></i>固定A舱</div></div><div class="plot"><h2>Z–Y 侧剖：8.2mm深度过渡</h2><svg id="side" viewBox="0 0 420 660" aria-label="side view"></svg><div class="legend"><i style="background:var(--hot)"></i>跨舱FPC中性线　<i style="background:var(--screen)"></i>OLED仅画U形区域示意</div></div></section></div>
<div class="notes">模型输入：R17 的两舱各高94.25mm，B上移79.75mm，最后前移8.2mm；新跨舱FPC单层等效厚0.12mm、可见宽3mm、U回弯R5mm，均为<strong>概念参数</strong>。真实FPC层数、铜厚、接口、电流、阻抗、疲劳以及 OLED 材料/接触均未放行。</div></div><script>
const ys=document.getElementById('ys'),zs=document.getElementById('zs');const r=5,Ay=5,By0=5,zA=4.1,travel=79.75,zmove=8.2;
function smooth(t){return t*t*(3-2*t)}function ds(t){return 6*t*(1-t)}
function leg(ly,dz){let n=96,h=1/n,sum=0;for(let i=0;i<=n;i++){let t=i*h;let val=Math.hypot(ly,dz*ds(t));sum+=(i===0||i===n?1:(i%2?4:2))*val;}return sum*h/3}
const total=65-Ay+Math.PI*r+leg(65-By0,-8.2);
function solve(y,q){let by=y+By0,dz=-8.2+q,lo=Math.max(Ay,by)+.00001,hi=200;for(let j=0;j<65;j++){let mid=(lo+hi)/2,l=mid-Ay+Math.PI*r+leg(mid-by,dz);if(l>total)hi=mid;else lo=mid;}let cy=(lo+hi)/2,pts=[];
for(let j=0;j<=35;j++){let t=j/35;pts.push([23.4,Ay+(cy-Ay)*t,zA])}
for(let j=1;j<=35;j++){let theta=Math.PI*(1-j/35);pts.push([28.4+r*Math.cos(theta),cy+r*Math.sin(theta),zA])}
for(let j=1;j<=35;j++){let t=j/35;pts.push([33.4,cy-(cy-by)*t,zA+dz*smooth(t)])}
return {cy,pts,L:cy-Ay+Math.PI*r+leg(cy-by,dz)}}
function pose(y,z){ys.value=y;zs.value=z;update()}
function update(){let y=+ys.value;if(y<travel-.0001)zs.value=0;let z=+zs.value, s=solve(y,z);document.getElementById('yv').textContent=y.toFixed(2)+' mm';document.getElementById('zv').textContent=z.toFixed(2)+' mm';document.getElementById('len').textContent=s.L.toFixed(3);document.getElementById('fold').textContent=(s.cy+5).toFixed(2);
const plan=document.getElementById('plan'),side=document.getElementById('side');const C='#334960';
function mapPlan([x,v]){return [(x+40)*4.75,600-v*3.25]}
function mapSide([x,v,z]){return [(z+11)*15.0,600-v*3.25]}
function path(points,fn){return points.map((p,i)=>{let [a,b]=fn(p);return(i?'L':'M')+a.toFixed(2)+' '+b.toFixed(2)}).join(' ')}
function rect(x1,y1,x2,y2,fn){let [px,py]=fn([x1,y1]),[qx,qy]=fn([x2,y2]);return `<rect x="${Math.min(px,qx)}" y="${Math.min(py,qy)}" width="${Math.abs(qx-px)}" height="${Math.abs(qy-py)}"/>`}
let rectA=rect(-36.995,0,36.995,94.25,mapPlan),rectB=rect(-36.995,y,36.995,y+94.25,mapPlan);
plan.innerHTML=`<g stroke="#788b9e" fill="#9badbc" fill-opacity=".08">${rectA}</g><g stroke="#4e9ae0" fill="#4e9ae0" fill-opacity=".08">${rectB}</g><path d="${path(s.pts,mapPlan)}" stroke="#ff9956" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/><g font-size="13" fill="#ccdbea"><text x="20" y="627">X / mm →</text><text x="20" y="25">Y ↑</text></g>`;
function mapBlock(zl,yl,zh,yh){let [px,py]=mapSide([0,yl,zl]),[qx,qy]=mapSide([0,yh,zh]);return `<rect x="${Math.min(px,qx)}" y="${Math.min(py,qy)}" width="${Math.abs(qx-px)}" height="${Math.abs(qy-py)}"/>`}
const Ua=y+94.25-(3.4+.60),zc=7.6-8.2+z;let screen=[[0,3,7.6],[0,79.75,7.6],[0,Ua,zc]],scrU=[];
for(let j=0;j<=25;j++){let a=Math.PI*j/25;scrU.push([0,Ua+3.4*Math.sin(a),zc-3.4+3.4*Math.cos(a)])}
side.innerHTML=`<g fill="#9badbc" fill-opacity=".08" stroke="#778798">${mapBlock(0,0,7.2,94.25)}</g><g stroke="#4e9ae0" fill="#4e9ae0" fill-opacity=".08">${mapBlock(-8.2+z,y,-1+z,y+94.25)}</g><path d="${path(s.pts,mapSide)}" fill="none" stroke="#ff9956" stroke-width="3"/><path d="${path(scrU,mapSide)}" fill="none" stroke="#26ced2" stroke-width="3"/><g font-size="13" fill="#ccdbea"><text x="20" y="627">Z / mm →</text><text x="20" y="25">Y ↑</text></g>`;
}ys.addEventListener('input',update);zs.addEventListener('input',update);update();</script></body></html>
